# cargo-fuzz build artifacts. The auto-generated corpus under
# `fuzz/corpus/<target>/` grows in size as the fuzzer discovers new
# coverage paths; the small hand-picked seed inputs under
# `fuzz/seeds/<target>/` ARE committed (typically 5–10 inputs per
# target) and serve as the starting corpus that `cargo +nightly
# fuzz run` copies into `fuzz/corpus/` on first run.
fuzz/target
fuzz/artifacts
fuzz/coverage
fuzz/corpus

